+- Python 3.10+; package checks and saved-result reproduction use the standard library.
+- Licensed PrimeSim HSPICE and an authorized CIC018 model are external requirements for new process simulations; they are not redistributed.
+- All simulation drivers accept `--hspice`, `--model` and `--check-environment`; no installation-specific fallback paths are used.
 - PDFLaTeX for standalone reports. Optional Matplotlib regenerates selected plots.
 
+The [fresh-download guide](REPRODUCING.md) provides one entry point that generates
+results without CAD, optional plotting requirements, prerequisite checks and
+a runnable copy of the unchanged instructor testbench.
+
 ```sh
 python verify_package.py
+python reproduce_saved.py --outdir reproduced/saved
 ```
 
